{"id":"n80953-1-7","stage":3,"title":"패스트푸드 · 快餐","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80953-1-7-1","ko":"오늘도 너무 바빠서 햄버거로 끼니를 때웠어.","zh":"今天也太忙了，就随便吃汉堡对付了一顿饭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘도","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘도","audio":"/audio/77d25b815bea9e75c627.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"바빠서","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바빠서","audio":"/audio/f983361aa92644829534.mp3"}},{"text":"햄버거로","meaning":"汉堡包，汉堡","explanation":"햄버거：汉堡包，汉堡；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"햄버거","audio":"/audio/dc09034ebbae18bbb14e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31843","senseId":"1","lemma":"햄버거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"햄버거로","audio":"/audio/45ff32dcb323b84b00ed.mp3"}},{"text":"끼니를","meaning":"顿","explanation":"끼니：顿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"끼니","audio":"/audio/fd45e7bedaab129d98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38436","senseId":"2","lemma":"끼니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끼니를","audio":"/audio/9f68b74428ed1b712fde.mp3"}},{"text":"때웠어.","meaning":"对付，顶，替","explanation":"때우다：对付，顶，替；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"때우다","audio":"/audio/c84920cb18f316753902.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50393","senseId":"2","lemma":"때우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때웠어","audio":"/audio/12ed0712d2284bce3cae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"dc09034ebbae18bb","term":"햄버거","zh":"汉堡包，汉堡","audio":"/audio/dc09034ebbae18bbb14e.mp3","entryId":"31843","definition":"把肉、蔬菜和芝士等夹在圆面包里的食物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"fd45e7bedaab129d","term":"끼니","zh":"顿","audio":"/audio/fd45e7bedaab129d98a6.mp3","entryId":"38436","definition":"数吃食物进餐次数的单位。","pronunciation":["끼니"]},{"id":"c84920cb18f31675","term":"때우다","zh":"对付，顶，替","audio":"/audio/c84920cb18f316753902.mp3","entryId":"50393","definition":"用简单的食物代替正餐。","pronunciation":["때우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a846c365f7cf6f70b244.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80953-1-7-2","ko":"저런. 자꾸 패스트푸드를 먹으면 몸에 안 좋아.","zh":"哎呀，老是吃快餐对身体可不好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런.","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀。","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"패스트푸드를","meaning":"快餐","explanation":"패스